From b27cebfe162ad3eff7a139e2ca08f4de396d426b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:46:28 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Prometheus/Grafana wiring; add provisioned AuditFlow
 dashboard

- prometheus.yml: scrape fastapi:8000 (was backend:8000, a non-existent
  service) with explicit /metrics path; Postgres job left as an opt-in
  comment since the DB is Neon.
- docker-compose.yml: put prometheus, grafana and exporters on the shared
  network; point redis-exporter at redis-primary (was redis); make
  postgres-exporter opt-in via a profile and an env-var DSN; read the
  Grafana admin password from GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD.
- grafana/: provisioned Prometheus datasource and a 24-panel overview
  dashboard (HTTP latency/errors, session lock wait/timeouts, index
  version current vs loaded, cache reloads, PG pool saturation,
  refresh-token reuse).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EgSuF1U5kDij8YZySminES
---
 .gitignore                                    |    3 +
 docker-compose.yml                            |   32 +-
 grafana/dashboards/auditflow-overview.json    | 1155 +++++++++++++++++
